//
// A cluster of nodes keeps a set of append-only logs, each named by a string
// key. Each log entry lives at a fixed, monotonically increasing integer
// offset. Clients append values with "send", read them back with "poll", and
// record their progress with "commit_offsets" / "list_committed_offsets".
